+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,10 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Use selected PHP for external formatting.** Editor formatting with PHP-script Pint, php-cs-fixer and phpcbf, including Pint Blade, uses the selected local interpreter. Invalid selections refuse PHP execution; standalone CLI formatting keeps its inherited interpreter. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Refresh dependencies when installed metadata changes.** Composer dependency completion and navigation refresh after the project's installed metadata is created, changed or removed, including configured vendor directories. Unsaved project files are retained. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Readable documentation tables.** PHP hover documentation displays supported HTML tables as readable rows, retaining their captions and explanations. Unsupported markup stays visible. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Use the selected PHP for analyzer scripts.** PHPStan, PHPCS and PHPMD script diagnostics use the editor-selected local interpreter for file and project analysis. Invalid selections report an error; native tools and custom launchers keep their own execution policy. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
